# Cloudflare Pages — _redirects
# Apex normalisation
https://www.wayward.house/*  https://wayward.house/:splat  301!

# Books — each is a separate Cloudflare Pages deploy. We rewrite the apex's
# /<book>/* to the book project's URL. Configure these in the Cloudflare
# dashboard once each book has its own Pages project; the lines below are
# the canonical mapping used by the design.
#
# Until books are deployed, /<book>/ is served by THIS site (a stub front
# page produced by src/pages/[book]/index.astro). The rewrite kicks in once
# the destination is live.
#
# /computational-geography/*  https://computational-geography.pages.dev/:splat  200
# /mathematics/*              https://mathematics.pages.dev/:splat              200
# /math-for-data-science-ai/* https://math-ds-ai.pages.dev/:splat               200
# /data-engineering/*         https://data-engineering.pages.dev/:splat         200
# /systems-thinking/*         https://systems-thinking.pages.dev/:splat         200
